    "summary_short": "After completing her first mission in space, astronaut Sam Walker is moved to a remote, high-security NASA facility for medical evaluation and rehabilitation. What should be a peaceful recovery quickly deteriorates as terrifying, unexplained events plague the property. Fearing for her safety and sanity, Sam begins to suspect that something non-human returned with her from orbit. As NASA personnel dismiss her concerns, she must unravel the truth before the unseen force destroys her.",
